                <UserObject label="" tooltip="This is for when money needs to pour from one FlowObject into many. It pours into a &quot;splitter&quot;, and from there pours into other FlowObjects according to some rules. There are two types of rules represented as an enumeration:&#xa;&#xa;  0 -&gt; NONE (Results in Error)&#xa;  1 -&gt; Static - the values specified are static, hard dollar amounts taken out.&#xa;  2 -&gt; Percentage - The values specified are a percentage of the total (0%-100%)&#xa;&#xa;The &quot;values&quot; referenced are those in the rule pair table" id="80">
